@dshfiles/mermaid-diagrams

The build copies the ES module build of pele 1.13.0 (https://github.com/obsidianmd/pele,
https://www.npmjs.com/package/pele), Copyright (c) 2026 kepano, licensed under the MIT
License, into dist/renderer/ together with its LICENSE file, and KaTeX 0.16.47's
dist/katex.mjs (https://github.com/KaTeX/KaTeX), Copyright (c) 2013-2020 Khan Academy and
other contributors, licensed under the MIT License, as dist/renderer/katex.mjs with its
