package modifies neither.

The rendering approach (pele over Mermaid.js, the code until the fence is complete, a
Diagram/Code toggle, click to expand into a themed SVG image, and --pele-* theme variables
mapped to the app theme) follows t3code's MermaidDiagram and MarkdownMermaidCodeBlock
