Three pieces are ported from t3code's MermaidDiagram.tsx and adapted: the two DOMPurify
profiles (src/sanitize.ts), the KaTeX math resolver with its MathML tag and attribute
lists (src/renderer-loader.ts, src/sanitize.ts) and the themed SVG image used by expand
(src/mermaid-fence.tsx). The components themselves are written against the DSH chat
code-fence registry.
